flowchart TD
    Scan["TmpScriptRewriter.ScanProject(paths, assetsRoot)"]
    Gate["MightMentionTmp: contains TMP, TextMeshPro or Dropdown?"]
    RW["Rewrite(source)"]
    Mask["CodeMask: lexer marks strings, char literals, comments as not-code"]
    Enums["EnumBodies: spans between enum braces"]
    Edits["TypeEdits: whole identifier chains against the Types map; Where() must answer Position.Type"]
    Usings["using TMPro; becomes using OneText.UGUI; (+ using OneText; for OneTextMesh), trailing comment kept"]
    Res["Residuals: TMP_*, TMPro_*, TMPro, TextMeshPro, TextMeshProUGUI still standing"]
    Block["Blocker: using went but a Reference residual stays, or using unreadable with short names: original text back, Viable=false"]
    Graph["TmpAssemblyGraph.Owner(path) + Missing(owner, RequiredAssemblies)"]
    Groups["Groups: extension methods on mapped types and public members in TMP terms tie files together"]
    Report["TmpScanReport: Files (TmpScriptFinding) + Groups (TmpFileGroup)"]
    Apply["Hub Apply: re-Rewrite from disk, write file; Patch asmdef on request"]

    Scan --> Gate -- yes --> RW
    RW --> Mask --> Enums --> Edits --> Usings --> Res --> Block
    Block --> Graph --> Groups --> Report --> Apply
